Z||000000||ChadMan||08-30-2001||01:15 PM||||Two guys in a giant four-door pickup pulled up next to me at a light about half an hour ago.<P>Guy:  How many miles you got on that?<BR>Me:  125,000.<BR>Guy:  Runs good, doesn't it?<BR>Me:  Sure does.  You got one?<BR>Guy:  No.  I always wanted one, though.<BR>Me:  I'll sell you this one for $1800.<BR>Guy:  Really?  What year is it?<BR>Me:  1988.  Last year they made 'em.<BR>Guy (frantically searches for paper):  What's your name and number?<P>So there's a slight chance a complete stranger might want to buy my Fiero.  If he does, I'm going Fiero shopping baby!||||reg||7
