Z||000007||Fformula88||08-30-2001||05:40 PM||||I had a guy from a few blocks away walk up to me one day while I was washing my car and ask how much I'd take for it.  So I gave my standard answer of $6000.  I figure if some sucker is willing to give me that much for an 82K miles 88 Formula I paid $2800 for when it had 67K miles, I'd take it!<P>Well, he wanted to try and talk me down.  Turns out he wanted the body panels because his son had one that was in a wreck and was rebuilding it!  I was actually a little insulted that he thought my car was a good "parts car"!  The paint on it is nearly flawless except for stone chips in the front cowl and a couple small scratches.  It runs fine and the interior minus the seats is mint!<P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierosig2.JPG"> <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
