Z||000011||LZeitgeist||08-30-2001||09:47 PM||||One time I was walking back out to the Formula across a grocery store parking lot, and a police car stopped near the car.. the passenger side window rolled down and the officer on that side asked me if that was my car... I told him yes, it was - he asked if I'd be interesting in selling it. I smiled, told him, "Nope, no way, no how... but I'm flattered you asked..."<P>He asked, "Don't you even want to hear an offer?"  I told him, "Nope, it'd have to be five figures before I'd even consider it... ::smile::"<P>He smiled and said he definitely understood - he used to have one just like it, and the Fiero bug bit him hard seeing me driving around town... we chatted a bit, and I took his e-mail address and told him I'd keep an eye out for one for him. <P><P>------------------<BR>Patrick W. Heinske  --  LZeitgeist@aol.com<BR>1988 Red Fiero Formula<BR>- 1st Place - Stock Coupe - FOCOSEVA 2000<BR>- 3rd Place - Stock Formula - FOCOA Nat'l 2001||||reg||1
