Z||000014||ChadMan||08-31-2001||09:30 AM||||Hey, Jason, I wasn't slamming you, buddy - I know you really DO have a bunch of Fieros.  I was jealous of everybody posting their good deals and thought I'd make a joke.<P>"It's at my dad's" was a reference to all the guys I knew in high school who would tell you about the great motorcycles/cars/girlfriends they had, but they were at their Dad's place in Wisconsin or their uncle's place in Kentucky...yeah right!||||reg||10
